<title>UK: UK green rate change to cut farm incomes.</title>
<headline>UK green rate change to cut farm incomes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tuesday's revaluation in sterling's green rate will hit farm incomes and, indirectly, cut the price of grain.</p>
<p>But the effect on consumers is likely to be limited.</p>
</text>
